  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analyses of blended finance operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the consultancy is to answer three over-arching questions: (i) What is the current situation in relation to blended finance operations? (ii) What are the preconditions for success of blended finance operations and to which extent are these preconditions currently being fulfilled? (iii) What should be improved to make blended finance instruments more efficient?</narrative>
  </description>
